            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Post-Presidency Legal Troubles</strong><br>\nAfter losing the presidency in 2012, Sarkozy faced multiple legal investigations, including charges of corruption and influence peddling, which he denied.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Political Comeback Attempts</strong><br>\nSarkozy attempted a political comeback, seeking the Republican party's nomination for the presidency in 2016, but was unsuccessful.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Current Activities and Public Role</strong><br>\nThough retired from political life, Sarkozy remains a prominent public figure, releasing memoirs and engaging in public speaking, while his legal troubles continue to surface periodically.</p>\n"
              },
